$ krowk workspaces
stdout:
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "stored": [],
    "resolved": "ws_x",
    "source": "repo config",
    "key_missing": true
  },
  "summary": "ws_x resolves here (repo config) but holds no key — every upload fails until `krowk login`",
